# Enemy_KingSlime - the boss slime (Tools/Blender/enemies/models_bosses.py king_slime()): a wide green jelly dome with
# a lighter lime jelly cap that drips over the brow, smug dark brows, big cute eyes, a wide grin with one tooth, and a
# gold crown (band, three front spikes, red velvet cushion showing between them, red and cyan gems on the tips).
# 3/4 view turned to the viewer's right like Enemy_Slime: the face sits right of centre, the far eye is narrower.
size 48 48
symmetric x
key
  O #143a2c  body outline, brows (darkest green)
  D #1d6b47  core shadow, sel-out round the eyes
  S #32994c  shadow / reflected light
  G #4ebb54  jelly base (palette green 10)
  C #a3d149  lime jelly cap
  L #dcf28a  cap light
  E #e4e7f3  eye white, tooth, glints, gloss
  P #21182c  pupil
  k #5c360c  gold outline
  g #a8661a  gold shadow
  y #e8a830  gold
  Y #ffd65a  gold light
  m #6a1222  velvet / gem outline, mouth
  R #c42e40  velvet, red gems, tongue
  c #5fd0d8  cyan gems
  B #e88aa6  blush
